      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been dealing with some really bad heartburn and a gnawing pain in my stomach lately, like a constant ache. i think it might be an ulcer or something. anyway, i have a killer headache right now, what's the best thing i can take for the pain? i have some advil in the cabinet i can use?",
