      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the warning. i'll skip the advil then. i do have some aspirin in the house though, is that any different? i really don't want to go to a doctor right now, it's so expensive and i'm pretty sure i can just manage this with something from the cupboard. wouldn't aspirin be okay since it's just for the headache?",
